  "en": {
    "id": 5013041,
    "name": "Daybreak Squadron: Azurewing",
    "desc": "The pinnacle of logic and composure... or is he? He maintains a constant air of unshakeable calm, as if he's a walking encyclopedia of wisdom and lore, but at his core, he's just a sardonic loser with a talent for snark.\\n\"My job is simply to decide what to do. As for whether it's actually possible... well, that's for you all to worry about... Holy Aha, you guys are actually doing it!?\"\\nCleaving the heavens! Wings spread like lightning! Warrior of the cyan welkin — Azurewing Warrior!\\nDarkness wanes, and dawn awakens! The Daybreak Squadron arises!",
    "monster_camp_id": 17,
    "attack_base": 3,
    "critical_damage_base": 0.2,
